 (text "Supervisor: Raspberry Pi Pico in sockets (GPIO map: PINMAP.md)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 3 3) (thickness 0.5) bold) (justify left)) (uuid "bf3c66c9-65b2-50e9-a251-98886ddd351d"))
(text "Pico VSYS from +5V through the 1N5817; its 3V3(OUT) is the board +3V3 (about 300 mA available)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 33.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "c4617e19-33e9-5f4b-acc2-5b2b91474023"))
(text "Its micro-USB goes to a dev-kit USB-A (USB CDC link), or to hub port 4 (J603) for flashing from the laptop." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "be734b8d-fe83-5ee9-b2df-8eaf513f87c9"))
(text "ADC dividers 100k / 18k: 16.8 V -> 2.56 V, 20 V -> 3.05 V, 30 V -> 4.6 V through 15k (65 uA into the clamp)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 43.18000000000001 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "fb5ac042-e98b-5838-a3e2-9bd5def7278b"))
(text "BAT_SENSE is taken from VSYS_SW (equals the pack when on) so no divider drains the pack while the car is off." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 48.260000000000005 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "57d0ea42-c332-535e-b265-1964096af9e3"))
(text "Status LEDs from GP17 / GP18 through 470 Ohm (2.8 mA, within the default 4 mA drive)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 53.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "f6d93498-976a-5885-8e03-323fcb93edd9"))
